            <div xml:id="m-099fefc6-a37f-4984-8101-6183d0ae25ae">
              <lg xml:id="m-f5ee47ce-dda8-4ebb-a43c-ee343664fdb1">
                <l xml:id="m-69a1000a-1566-46c2-8e7d-5c9ba9cec8b4" facs="#m-74b758f6-1c06-4967-8641-ba5ac31aa094" label="ambiguous">809</l><l xml:id="m-0fa18622-cdc9-4db6-9756-f43c9b1ffebb" facs="#m-ad1c1e15-8696-4f4d-b982-e46c9d6995b6" label="text-like">Low Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-8355ac6b-d1d5-4471-a078-8a08da405d6b" facs="#m-b8ccbc03-ac4b-473b-90eb-94876d324323" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Allelúia. as in the Psalter. D. 236. Chapter of Vespers. Caríssimi:</l><l xml:id="m-5ffaee60-b8af-43fc-ba6e-41e1689bdb38" facs="#m-484f195c-b647-4010-93f8-c983c4872e66" label="lyrics-like">Omne quod. p. 812. Short Resp. Surréxit Dóminus. p. 239. V. Surréxit.</l><l xml:id="m-28f77c0f-fa04-405b-9a6d-f2cab9a14a7d" facs="#m-44f4827e-86ee-4800-a30f-69ff1eadba45" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-5aab16d3-e1c2-4168-8ce3-df72557941b6" facs="#m-06337dcf-34f4-4f70-b465-00d982b47e8d" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-14d47ebd-5bc0-45e6-968e-7363dadbb93a" facs="#m-3fa185ef-feb8-401b-bd42-d32d0c113c24" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-5dc33f06-5828-4ce7-81b3-edab46946d7d" facs="#m-863c6667-019c-471c-97a9-38630f7b84c2" label="lyrics-like">Ua-si modo“ gé- ni-ti infántes, alle¬ lú¬ ia:</l><l xml:id="m-bbb4702e-4c8a-4c17-9469-8c1d21046726" facs="#m-fa2f1e30-2bc4-4ee5-be48-00c0d4bdf42d" label="lyrics-like">ra-ti-o-ná-bi-les, si-ne dó-lo</l><l xml:id="m-3106171a-8ed0-4761-856e-4bce62cad626" facs="#m-55af5c38-8777-44e2-80b1-ebbb078a1b5b" label="lyrics-like">lac concupí-sci-te,</l><l xml:id="m-d1e0787d-4035-40ce-ab44-cfce81521775" facs="#m-1d6c6fa2-67e6-4680-8ce2-e17f965a09e5" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia. Ps. Exsultá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba66d329-71c1-4abe-a5ce-75dc397ecfb5" facs="#m-b62a7128-db67-4fb8-b908-068bff52cddf" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia, alle-lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-58a1bf86-9a5a-4931-a278-3e60689635a5" facs="#m-39c0fd1b-5422-45db-b472-cf64ce83f120" label="lyrics-like">te Dé-o adju-tó-ri nóstro:*jubi-lá-te Dé-Jácob. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-19b20c33-8681-44e8-b29e-5cff0f8bb036" facs="#m-e82f2a68-d716-4e4a-88f2-3e8a5dca556a" label="lyrics-like">ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-12c03321-18d4-4837-a629-55ac9dcf1221" facs="#m-e7a4a279-3487-4c59-a98d-f1aafd48e6f3" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-bf9d1137-f4fd-4aad-b2fd-4824e081b150" facs="#m-3ee7daa6-cdfe-4bc0-9662-5a1deeb1f22e" label="lyrics-like">Raesta, quaésumus omnípotens ] móribus et vita teneámus. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-13a47114-2b30-4581-a284-2744214ee85f" facs="#m-02a29f38-3027-4b2b-81a8-0c0baf252f3d" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: f ut qui paschália festa</l><l xml:id="m-af417fbc-f9db-4eb6-b3c7-1c3af535d07a" facs="#m-da1dbe13-e03d-475e-a6d1-d8f549fc4886" label="ambiguous">minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-8075ce99-b240-4e64-a0cc-cb46c8c68fb5" facs="#m-0b8696a5-435e-4e3d-87f7-fec36f8c3c43" label="lyrics-like">perégimus, haec, te largiénte,</l><l xml:id="m-03e57534-7332-4c04-95e7-e9a0ba533962" facs="#m-06349cc4-ebf4-416a-908d-cc22207ec425" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Joannis Apostoli. I. Joann. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-49d23511-a17c-4827-8a38-af85213080d9" facs="#m-6884b9c3-e8a1-4b34-9229-d678fea5cf58" label="lyrics-like">(VAríssimi: Omne, quod natum! Pater, Verbum, et Spíritus Sanctus:</l><l xml:id="m-5f83412a-1f8d-4d62-a6b0-e0d8b3359061" facs="#m-5bca3eb9-65a1-4dbb-a634-c33d81fc6562" label="ambiguous">L est ex Deo, vincit mundum: et</l><l xml:id="m-92306c09-0190-4754-a557-54e280202e41" facs="#m-0e6f2563-cf95-45f3-955c-ce00b53ea829" label="ambiguous">et hi tres unum sunt. Et tres sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-a2d8db22-7306-4eec-9fb7-180d6440d368" facs="#m-646fa9f3-040b-47ab-ae82-61adc5a230a1" label="lyrics-like">qui testimónium dant in terra : Spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-72192d6c-c631-41ca-894f-78a8cd5b3e66" facs="#m-3e857d55-556b-4d6c-8056-61fb94187415" label="lyrics-like">haec est victória, quae vincit mun¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7fd3147-771e-4e89-8e27-a5050bd4a30b" facs="#m-d9e96a75-7cdd-44ba-b4fa-74f922dace97" label="ambiguous">dum, fides nostra. Quis est, qui</l><l xml:id="m-bbbe4d78-ea5d-4f63-a575-710529e37ca1" facs="#m-ae12538d-6e14-489c-b51c-c40a0896ec92" label="ambiguous">ritus, et aqua, et sanguis: et hi tres</l><l xml:id="m-5d0f9e47-e1ae-4b4a-ac01-b8d3f4e04f50" facs="#m-17a8b37a-3d8a-40e6-b951-b6bb5e3b6b1f" label="lyrics-like">unum sunt. Si testimónium hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-49f2cc58-a889-4b5e-8556-ff2d82b7eb45" facs="#m-a42df543-48ec-4c33-8cf5-084e400aeba4" label="lyrics-like">vincit mundum, nisi qui credit, quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae3bb989-ca56-48a6-b4f6-4c064c4b6695" facs="#m-450f0274-d2dc-4f44-8488-1d192ddc160b" label="ambiguous">niam Jesus est Filius Dei? Hic' est</l><l xml:id="m-f9ee11f5-4338-4d5f-9f8a-71601af40534" facs="#m-bcf6dd09-576a-4df7-a88f-e95e3c95f176" label="lyrics-like">num accípimus, testimónium Dei</l><l xml:id="m-61ef1550-eaba-42df-85cc-860183930a61" facs="#m-5b864e6e-bf9d-46b7-be50-fbdd6c5f931d" label="lyrics-like">majus est : quóniam hoc est testi¬</l><l xml:id="m-568bfc76-db9d-43a9-abda-94dd6a4d2ca9" facs="#m-eed78de6-25a9-4d18-98d0-ef629f71acaf" label="lyrics-like">qui venit per aquam, et sánguinem,</l><l xml:id="m-f3b36a27-40ee-431a-90cf-2dfb8dfc0b6c" facs="#m-4715f021-3742-4767-9458-44a275ab8f39" label="lyrics-like">mónium Dei quod majus est: quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a00b69fa-5e95-4dff-83fb-5cac3235759c" facs="#m-fae0cb07-5d38-4805-960d-b4dece71a37c" label="ambiguous">Jesus Christus : non in aqua solum,</l><l xml:id="m-245ce382-bbbd-456c-94d9-93fbda40f2da" facs="#m-bc463820-ba02-4fb5-8386-a068660bc618" label="lyrics-like">sed in aqua et sánguine. Et Spíritus</l><l xml:id="m-7442727e-c2b4-49d4-bb98-f455c90eab1a" facs="#m-67e45858-cb24-42ee-aa04-2618b1176995" label="lyrics-like">niam testificátus est de Fllio suo.</l><l xml:id="m-1af9f25d-05c1-4e5e-b444-66774149c7d3" facs="#m-d5ee05a1-d6b5-4fe6-9a2e-3aa61f9ad798" label="ambiguous">Qui credit in Filium Dei, habet te¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ba0d7b8-3065-4176-b9d4-55a61953590c" facs="#m-dba00dd5-435c-4d10-9ad3-a7cb124dc234" label="lyrics-like">est, qui testificátur, quóniam Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-924e537c-770d-43c2-86fe-c86fbed2f3b5" facs="#m-a289a01e-b186-490c-91fc-d0faecabda73" label="lyrics-like">stus est véritas. Quóniam tres sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-1c923d51-dcbd-41b8-b44a-b5e7a0fe2982" facs="#m-cc582974-cbbd-4604-9673-3fb7f5f49232" label="lyrics-like">stimónium Dei in se.</l><l xml:id="m-4609d7ae-adb8-4913-93b3-b2da080d508c" facs="#m-6ed56215-6576-4489-8fd5-a3eabbef3c75" label="lyrics-like">qui testimónium dant in caelo</l><l xml:id="m-e2851f00-b335-4771-9179-e88f18ccbb48" facs="#m-748bfcd2-4bdc-414d-81a6-c476df5f9b75" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-d5f9e321-747d-42c5-a096-324d1a52ac8d" facs="#m-9c193a73-2695-45d7-a797-d4ca7b201918" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-6c079087-09ef-4872-83b4-ff6377b04296" facs="#m-de4444f1-d0c1-41e3-a9a0-cd845b8660b2" label="ambiguous">ij.</l><l xml:id="m-b9b7763e-b907-4eb4-99a5-0d9aa05c7a9f" facs="#m-ad99483d-405e-49f2-ae42-ca220c176da2" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-69d39a8e-979a-435e-8ead-207b1bb310c6" facs="#m-31b30904-98f1-478d-9f89-298595d7e372" label="ambiguous">ia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
